  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cashew sub sector ConnectCaju - Bridging period</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging mechanism for the Cashew sub-sector support to enable:
a) Smooth continuation of activities under Moz-19/0012 which were creation of sustainable jobs, increased incomes and economic growth along the cashew value chain through (i) improved farmer services, (ii) inclusion of service providers and (iii) Improved capacity of the regulators (INCAJU), and 
b) To determine what a potential (next) intervention should look like.</narrative>
  </description>
